WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Vine was the first short-form video hosting service allowing users to share a maximum of six second looping videos.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:02.000
Fan edits specifically belonged to fandom communities that had to be sought out in these digital spaces. You had to be active in these digital spaces to get these videos recommended

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:53.000
 Vine is a critical turning point due to the six second video format. Challenging the editing community to create captivating videos under six seconds. 

